    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tier-free H2 sections and the new Memory Webs section[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]section[dim] · [dim][/dim]after webkind[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: rename the generated H2 anchors to Core Memory / Memory Webs / [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Reference Memory, rename the AGENTS template variables, render web [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptors into the new middle section, and teach the AGENTS.md parser [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and TUI rail the three-group shape.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, memory notes, and regenerated artifacts[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after section[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: rewrite the tier vocabulary in docs/, the generated sase.md and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README memory templates, the affected glossary strands, and a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision record, then regenerate and commit every generated artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]here and in the chezmoi linked repo.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-vk","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-vk.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["sase-vk.2"],"workflow_name":"sase-vk.3"},"source_run_id":"run-2ec16f078d0517af16b516c250b85d3c","started_at":"2026-08-30T09:55:29.028699+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f52ab15a86653b21ba1e6b17e9de1bbe6a5ea4a3fb1a9366a8e3e58febfd67cc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vk.land.w0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"dige